## Device file

```yaml
device: ${title} example
connect: { driver: ${name}, target: "sim:example" }
read:
  temperature: { unit: degC, every: 1 s }
write:
  level: { unit: percent, min: 0, max: 100, max_change_per_s: 20 }
safe_state: { level: 0 }
```

